    "note": "Datasheet of DS-7616NXI-K2/16P (D) (2024-05-23): \"PoE Interface 16, RJ-45 10/100 Mbps self-adaptive Ethernet interface\", \"Power <= 200 W\", \"Standard IEEE 802.3af/at\"; LAN is \"1 RJ-45 10/100/1000 Mbps self-adaptive Ethernet interface\". Same 200 W as the DS-7616NI-K2/16P it supersedes, on the same sixteen 10/100 camera ports. Read 2026-11-20 (200, application/pdf, 987,036 B, 5 pp)."
  },
  "notes": "PoE out: sixteen 10/100 Mbps camera ports, 802.3af/at, on a 200 W aggregate budget (datasheet \"Power <= 200 W\"); 16 x 30 W of 802.3at ceiling is 480 W, so the supply is the limit. The PoE ports are plug-and-play on the recorder's own subnet, so a camera is not routable from the LAN unless the uplink is bridged. Wired only, no PoE input."
